# The vampire's garden (4fjarvamp), then a JARDIM win in the 1995 controls: WinExec at the scene
# start, JARDIM's WM_CREATE at 1500, jardim-alone-win.input's presses shifted by 1500, the win at
# 73750. In the Original JARDIM posts 0x40c on every message and never reads NOITE's ack, which
# 4fjarvamp sends for every 0x40c: the two bounce messages for the whole game (the port's clock
# runs on, as Windows'), the 8-message queues stay full and JARDIM's result is lost; NOITE then
# finds the window gone and reports itself a loss with no score: game over (6fsaida). BUGS.md
# J7. With every bug fix on the 1995 controls NOITE gets the win (+15340) and plays the second
# ending (6fsai2).
#
#   zig-out/bin/noite --headless --scene 4fjarvamp --ms 76000 --input tools/play/jardim-4fjarvamp-win.input
